end="00:05.107">a</span> <span begin="00:05.107" end="00:05.671">mo</span><span begin="00:05.671" end="00:05.798">ment</span> <span begin="00:05.798" end="00:05.901">be</span><span begin="00:05.901" end="00:06.267">fore</span> <span begin="00:06.267" end="00:06.561">I</span> <span begin="00:06.561" end="00:07.082">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">离开前我需要片刻理清思绪</span></p><p begin="00:08.622" end="00:11.248" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:08.622" end="00:08.831">It's</span> <span begin="00:08.831" end="00:09.039">no</span><span begin="00:09.039" end="00:09.376">thing</span> <span begin="00:09.376" end="00:10.130">per</span><span begin="00:10.454" end="00:10.818">son</span><span begin="00:10.818" end="00:11.248">al</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这无关私人恩怨</span></p><p begin="00:11.472" end="00:13.261" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:11.472" end="00:11.617">I</span> <span begin="00:11.617" end="00:11.997">draw</span> <span begin="00:11.997" end="00:12.195">the</span> <span begin="00:12.195" end="00:13.261">blinds</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">将百叶窗拉下</span></p><p begin="00:13.781" end="00:15.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:13.781" end="00:13.952">They</span> <span begin="00:13.952" end="00:14.115">don't</span> <span begin="00:14.115" end="00:14.264">need</span> <span begin="00:14.264" end="00:14.331">to</span> <span begin="00:14.331" end="00:14.735">see</span> <span begin="00:14.735" end="00:14.993">me</span> <span begin="00:14.993" end="00:15.960">cry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">没必要让别人看到我泪流满面</span></p><p begin="00:16.482" end="00:18.381" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:16.482" end="00:16.664">'Cause</span> <span begin="00:16.664" end="00:16.937">even</span> <span begin="00:16.937" end="00:17.110">if</span> <span begin="00:17.110" end="00:17.315">they</span> <span begin="00:17.315" end="00:17.616">un</span><span begin="00:17.616" end="00:17.874">der</span><span begin="00:17.874" end="00:18.381">stand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为即便他们能懂</span></p><p begin="00:19.604" end="00:21.887" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:19.604" end="00:19.794">They</span> <span begin="00:19.794" end="00:20.119">don't</span> <span begin="00:20.119" end="00:20.410">un</span><span begin="00:20.410" end="00:20.510">der</span><span begin="00:20.510" end="00:21.887">stand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他们也不能理解我</span></p><p begin="00:23.350" end="00:25.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:23.350" end="00:23.625">So</span> <span begin="00:23.625" end="00:23.875">then</span> <span begin="00:23.875" end="00:24.140">when</span> <span begin="00:24.140" end="00:24.269">I'm</span> <span begin="00:24.269" end="00:24.610">fin</span><span begin="00:24.610" end="00:25.000">ished</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所以当我站在最后的终点线</span></p><p begin="00:25.063" end="00:26.339" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:25.063" end="00:25.123">I'm</span> <span begin="00:25.123" end="00:25.366">all</span> <span begin="00:25.366" end="00:25.599">'bout</span> <span begin="00:25.599" end="00:25.813">my</span> <span begin="00:25.813" end="00:26.086">busi</span><span begin="00:26.086" end="00:26.339">ness</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">自始至终我都全力以赴</span></p><p begin="00:26.339" end="00:28.444" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:26.339" end="00:26.560">And</span> <span begin="00:26.560" end="00:27.015">ready</span> <span begin="00:27.015" end="00:27.142">to</span> <span begin="00:27.142" end="00:27.780">save</span> <span begin="00:27.780" end="00:27.960">the</span> <span begin="00:27.960" end="00:28.444">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我已蓄势待发 拯救世界</span></p><p begin="00:29.074" end="00:30.650" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:29.074" end="00:29.228">I'm</span> <span begin="00:29.228" end="00:29.556">tak</span><span begin="00:29.556" end="00:29.839">in'</span> <span begin="00:29.839" end="00:30.033">my</span> <span begin="00:30.033" end="00:30.336">mis</span><span begin="00:30.336" end="00:30.650">ery</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">承受着苦痛</span></p><p begin="00:30.766" end="00:31.711" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:30.766" end="00:30.994">Make</span> <span begin="00:30.994" end="00:31.244">it</span> <span begin="00:31.244" end="00:31.469">my</span> <span begin="00:31.469" end="00:31.711" amll:obscene="true">bitch</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">势在必得 亲爱的</span></p><p begin="00:31.711" end="00:34.265" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:31.711" end="00:31.960">Can't</span> <span begin="00:31.960" end="00:32.121">be</span> <span begin="00:32.121" end="00:32.664">every</span><span begin="00:32.664" end="00:32.933">one's</span> <span begin="00:32.933" end="00:33.189">fa</span><span begin="00:33.189" end="00:33.545">vourite</span> <span begin="00:33.545" end="00:34.265">girl</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你无法让所有人都爱你</span></p><p begin="00:34.413" end="00:37.418" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:34.413" end="00:34.899">So</span> <span begin="00:34.899" end="00:35.464">take</span> <span begin="00:35.464" end="00:36.012">aim</span> <span begin="00:36.012" end="00:36.225">and</span> <span begin="00:36.225" end="00:36.671">fire</span> <span begin="00:36.671" end="00:37.418">away</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就瞄准目标 果断出击吧</span></p><p begin="00:37.601" end="00:40.200" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:37.601" end="00:37.812">I've</span> <span begin="00:37.812" end="00:38.129">nev</span><span begin="00:38.129" end="00:38.347">er</span> <span begin="00:38.347" end="00:38.762">been</span> <span begin="00:38.762" end="00:39.241">so</span> <span begin="00:39.241" end="00:39.596">wide</span> <span begin="00:39.596" end="00:39.723">a</span><span begin="00:39.723" end="00:40.200">wake</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我从未如此清醒过</span></p><p begin="00:40.609" end="00:43.979" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:40.609" end="00:40.923">No,</span> <span begin="00:41.130" end="00:41.312">no</span><span begin="00:41.312" end="00:41.658">body</span> <span begin="00:41.658" end="00:42.053">but</span> <span begin="00:42.053" end="00:42.313">me</span> <span begin="00:42.313" end="00:42.692">can</span> <span begin="00:42.692" end="00:43.043">keep</span> <span begin="00:43.043" end="00:43.263">me</span> <span begin="00:43.263" end="00:43.979">safe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">除了自己 无人能护我周全</span></p><p begin="00:44.305" end="00:45.855" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:44.305" end="00:44.486">And</span> <span begin="00:44.486" end="00:44.804">I'm</span> <span begin="00:44.804" end="00:45.191">on</span> <span begin="00:45.191" end="00:45.521">my</span> <span begin="00:45.521" end="00:45.855">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此刻我已踏上征程</span></p><p begin="00:45.855" end="00:48.732" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:45.855" end="00:46.253">The</span> <span begin="00:46.253" end="00:46.780">blood</span> <span begin="00:46.780" end="00:47.303">moon</span> <span begin="00:47.303" end="00:47.721">is</span> <span begin="00:47.721" end="00:48.013">on</span> <span begin="00:48.013" end="00:48.190">the</span> <span begin="00:48.190" end="00:48.732">rise</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">天际那腥红血月已冉冉升起</span></p><p begin="00:48.732" end="00:51.625" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="00:48.732" end="00:48.977">The</span> <span begin="00:48.977" end="00:49.597">fire</span> <span begin="00:49.597" end="00:50.125">burn</span><span begin="00:50.125" end="00:50.477">ing</span> <span begin="00:50.477" end="00:50.791">in</span> <span begin="00:50.791" end="00:51.012">my</span> <span begin="00:51.012" end="00:51.625">eyes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">熊熊烈焰在我眸中炙热燃烧</span></p><p begin="00:51.896" end="00:55.246" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="00:51.896" end="00:52.193">No,</span> <span begin="00:52.426" end="00:52.624">no</span><span begin="00:52.624" end="00:52.970">body</span> <span begin="00:52.970" end="00:53.319">but</span> <span begin="00:53.319" end="00:53.567">me</span> <span begin="00:53.567" end="00:53.983">can</span> <span begin="00:53.983" end="00:54.365">keep</span> <span begin="00:54.365" end="00:54.553">me</span> <span begin="00:54.553" end="00:55.246">safe</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:51.991" end="00:53.319"><span begin="00:51.991" end="00:53.319">(No)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">除了自己 无人能护我周全</span></p><p begin="00:55.641" end="01:02.844" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="00:55.641" end="00:55.762">And</span> <span begin="00:55.762" end="00:56.179">I'm</span> <span begin="00:56.179" end="00:56.517">on</span> <span begin="00:56.517" end="00:56.784">my</span> <span begin="00:56.784" end="00:57.209">way</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:57.209" end="01:02.844"><span begin="00:57.209" end="00:57.543">(Belp,</span> <span begin="01:02.139" end="01:02.319">yah,</span> <span begin="01:02.319" end="01:02.844">yah)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">此刻我已踏上征程</span></p><p begin="01:10.557" end="01:14.495" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:10.557" end="01:10.760">Far</span><span begin="01:10.760" end="01:10.964">ru,</span> <span begin="01:11.721" end="01:13.088">yah-</span><span begin="01:13.088" end="01:13.599">yah,</span> <span begin="01:13.599" end="01:13.798">yah,</span> <span begin="01:13.798" end="01:14.495">yah</span></p><p begin="01:19.285" end="01:24.636" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:19.285" end="01:19.345">Lo</span> <span begin="01:19.345" end="01:19.805">sien</span><span begin="01:19.805" end="01:19.865">to</span> <span begin="01:19.865" end="01:20.269">mu</span><span begin="01:20.269" end="01:21.123">cho</span> <span begin="01:22.050" end="01:22.598">pero</span> <span begin="01:22.598" end="01:22.769">me</span> <span begin="01:22.769" end="01:23.480">voy</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:21.176" end="01:24.636"><span begin="01:21.176" end="01:21.390">(Far</span><span begin="01:21.390" end="01:21.547">ru,</span> <span begin="01:23.675" end="01:24.636">eh)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我满怀歉意 但我现在就要启程</span></p><p begin="01:24.842" end="01:30.159" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:24.842" end="01:24.979">Por</span> <span begin="01:24.979" end="01:25.173">que</span> <span begin="01:25.173" end="01:25.296">a</span> <span begin="01:25.296" end="01:25.597">tu</span> <span begin="01:25.597" end="01:26.335">lado</span> <span begin="01:26.335" end="01:26.648">me</span> <span begin="01:26.648" end="01:26.979">di</span> <span begin="01:26.979" end="01:27.368">cuen</span><span begin="01:27.368" end="01:27.686">ta</span> <span begin="01:27.686" end="01:27.894">que</span> <span begin="01:27.894" end="01:28.320">nada</span> <span begin="01:28.320" end="01:29.172">soy</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:28.949" end="01:30.159"><span begin="01:28.949" end="01:29.530">(Eh-</span><span begin="01:29.530" end="01:30.159">ey)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为在你的身边 我感觉空空如也</span></p><p begin="01:30.159" end="01:33.195" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:30.159" end="01:30.231">Y</span> <span begin="01:30.231" end="01:30.483">me</span> <span begin="01:30.483" end="01:30.583">can</span><span begin="01:30.583" end="01:30.847">sé</span> <span begin="01:30.847" end="01:30.950">de</span> <span begin="01:30.950" end="01:31.556">luchar</span> <span begin="01:31.556" end="01:31.723">y</span> <span begin="01:31.723" end="01:31.919">de</span> <span begin="01:31.919" end="01:32.243">guer</span><span begin="01:32.243" end="01:32.416">rear</span> <span begin="01:32.416" end="01:32.566">en</span> <span begin="01:32.566" end="01:33.195">vano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我已经厌倦了不停地争斗</span></p><p begin="01:33.195" end="01:35.981" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:33.195" end="01:33.281">De</span> <span begin="01:33.281" end="01:33.368">es</span><span begin="01:33.368" end="01:33.454">tar</span> <span begin="01:33.454" end="01:33.532">en</span> <span begin="01:33.532" end="01:33.660">la</span> <span begin="01:33.660" end="01:33.890">línea</span> <span begin="01:33.890" end="01:33.987">de</span> <span begin="01:33.987" end="01:34.443">fuego</span> <span begin="01:34.443" end="01:34.615">y</span> <span begin="01:34.615" end="01:34.790">de</span> <span begin="01:34.790" end="01:35.090">me</span><span begin="01:35.090" end="01:35.296">ter</span> <span begin="01:35.296" end="01:35.414">la</span> <span begin="01:35.414" end="01:35.981">mano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我会种下火种 送到你的手中</span></p><p begin="01:35.981" end="01:39.014" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:35.981" end="01:36.267">Acep</span><span begin="01:36.267" end="01:36.423">to</span> <span begin="01:36.423" end="01:36.696">mis</span> <span begin="01:36.696" end="01:36.872">er</span><span begin="01:36.872" end="01:37.392">rore',</span> <span begin="01:37.392" end="01:37.596">tam</span><span begin="01:37.596" end="01:37.969">bién</span> <span begin="01:37.969" end="01:38.075">soy</span> <span begin="01:38.075" end="01:38.488">hu</span><span begin="01:38.488" end="01:39.014">mano</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我接受你的教训 我只是个凡人而已</span></p><p begin="01:39.014" end="01:42.309" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:39.014" end="01:39.176">Y</span> <span begin="01:39.176" end="01:39.412">tú</span> <span begin="01:39.412" end="01:39.715">no</span> <span begin="01:39.715" end="01:40.033">ve'</span> <span begin="01:40.033" end="01:40.238">que</span> <span begin="01:40.238" end="01:40.407">lo</span> <span begin="01:40.407" end="01:40.588">hago</span> <span begin="01:40.588" end="01:40.748">por</span> <span begin="01:40.748" end="01:40.944">que</span> <span begin="01:40.944" end="01:41.162">te</span> <span begin="01:41.162" end="01:41.834">amo</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:41.325" end="01:42.309"><span begin="01:41.325" end="01:41.484">(Pum-</span><span begin="01:41.484" end="01:41.739">pum-</span><span begin="01:41.739" end="01:41.990">pum-</span><span begin="01:41.990" end="01:42.309">pum)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">而你永远不会这样教训我 因为我爱你</span></p><p begin="01:42.001" end="01:46.606" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:42.001" end="01:42.363">Pero</span> <span begin="01:42.363" end="01:43.378">ya</span> <span begin="01:43.931" end="01:44.120">no</span> <span begin="01:44.120" end="01:44.325">ten</span><span begin="01:44.325" end="01:44.412">go</span> <span begin="01:44.412" end="01:44.665">más</span> <span begin="01:44.665" end="01:44.827">na'</span> <span begin="01:44.827" end="01:44.948">que</span> <span begin="01:44.948" end="01:45.072">hac</span><span begin="01:45.072" end="01:45.187">er</span> <span begin="01:45.187" end="01:45.689">aquí</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:43.246" end="01:46.606"><span begin="01:43.246" end="01:44.176">(Ya,</span> <span begin="01:45.693" end="01:46.606">aquí)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但我这里没有别的事可做</span></p><p begin="01:46.708" end="01:49.440" ttm:agent="v2" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:46.708" end="01:46.958">Me</span> <span begin="01:46.958" end="01:47.309">voy,</span> <span begin="01:47.309" end="01:47.476">llegó</span> <span begin="01:47.476" end="01:47.666">la</span> <span begin="01:47.666" end="01:47.840">hora</span> <span begin="01:47.840" end="01:48.014">'e</span> <span begin="01:48.014"